msgid ""
"This plot shows how the probabilities of conclusive and misleading evidence "
"change with sample size while priors and thresholds are held fixed. Use it "
"to see how quickly the planned design becomes informative."
msgstr "此图显示在先验和阈值保持固定时，确定性证据和误导性证据的概率如何随样本量变化。用它来查看计划设计多快变得有信息量。"

msgid ""
"This plot shows how the probabilities of conclusive and misleading evidence "
"change across possible design proportions. Use it as a sensitivity check for "
"the assumed proportion under the design prior."
msgstr "此图显示确定性证据和误导性证据的概率如何在可能的设计比例间变化。将其用作设计先验下所假定比例的敏感性检验。"

msgid ""
"This plot shows how the probabilities of conclusive and misleading evidence "
"change across possible design-prior effect sizes. Use it as a sensitivity "
"check for the assumed effect size."
msgstr "此图显示确定性证据和误导性证据的概率如何在可能的设计先验效应量间变化。将其用作所假定效应量的敏感性检验。"

