msgid ""
"Analysis priors determine how the Bayes factor is computed from the data. "
"Design priors describe the data-generating assumptions used to evaluate the "
"design, so comparing them helps assess whether the planning assumptions "
"match the intended analysis."
msgstr "分析先验决定如何从数据计算贝叶斯因子。设计先验描述用于评估设计的数据生成假设，因此比较二者有助于评估规划假设是否与预期分析相符。"

